        "input": "3\n6 5 1 2 3\n2 2\n2 1\n1 10\n2 8\n2 4\n1 2\n1 4 2 5 1\n2 6\n6 5 1 2 3\n2 2\n2 1\n1 10\n2 8\n2 4\n1 6",
        "output": "5\n0\n6",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1:\nGiven N=6N = 6N=6, H=5H = 5H=5, Y1=1Y_{1} = 1Y1​=1, Y2=2Y_{2} = 2Y2​=2 and L=3L = 3L=3.\nHe passes the first three barriers by either ducking or jumping. He uses alchemic life force for breaking 4th4^{th}4th, 5th5^{th}5th and 6th6^{th}6th barriers because he cannot pass them by either jumping or ducking. He gets exhausted after breaking the 6th6^{th}6th barrier and is unable to pass it. So, in total he passes 555 barriers."
      }
